[[:db/add "071376c8-2284-526c-be29-4b6aa76ca8a3" :answer/id #uuid "071376c8-2284-526c-be29-4b6aa76ca8a3"] [:db/add "071376c8-2284-526c-be29-4b6aa76ca8a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "071376c8-2284-526c-be29-4b6aa76ca8a3" :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{9}"] [:db/ensure "071376c8-2284-526c-be29-4b6aa76ca8a3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "76d4a35d-8f3a-5fde-9014-f6f94077ba2f" :answer-field/id #uuid "76d4a35d-8f3a-5fde-9014-f6f94077ba2f"] [:db/add "76d4a35d-8f3a-5fde-9014-f6f94077ba2f" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "76d4a35d-8f3a-5fde-9014-f6f94077ba2f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "76d4a35d-8f3a-5fde-9014-f6f94077ba2f" :answer-field/choices "071376c8-2284-526c-be29-4b6aa76ca8a3"] [:db/add "76d4a35d-8f3a-5fde-9014-f6f94077ba2f" :answer-field/correct "071376c8-2284-526c-be29-4b6aa76ca8a3"] [:db/ensure "76d4a35d-8f3a-5fde-9014-f6f94077ba2f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "356c888e-b52d-504e-ba9f-9f4b4a3f15ea" :answer/id #uuid "356c888e-b52d-504e-ba9f-9f4b4a3f15ea"] [:db/add "356c888e-b52d-504e-ba9f-9f4b4a3f15ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "356c888e-b52d-504e-ba9f-9f4b4a3f15ea" :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{9}"] [:db/ensure "356c888e-b52d-504e-ba9f-9f4b4a3f15ea" :answer/validate] [:db/add "acde2936-d11f-58cc-b29e-e3774af4511b" :answer-field/id #uuid "acde2936-d11f-58cc-b29e-e3774af4511b"] [:db/add "acde2936-d11f-58cc-b29e-e3774af4511b" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "acde2936-d11f-58cc-b29e-e3774af4511b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "acde2936-d11f-58cc-b29e-e3774af4511b" :answer-field/choices "356c888e-b52d-504e-ba9f-9f4b4a3f15ea"] [:db/add "acde2936-d11f-58cc-b29e-e3774af4511b" :answer-field/correct "356c888e-b52d-504e-ba9f-9f4b4a3f15ea"] [:db/ensure "acde2936-d11f-58cc-b29e-e3774af4511b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a91daa27-1897-5aea-9a99-012820a6dea2" :question/id #uuid "a91daa27-1897-5aea-9a99-012820a6dea2"] [:db/add "a91daa27-1897-5aea-9a99-012820a6dea2" :question/problem "![](images/b3/b36ea011fb24a2bdad1002838450c888dfd4fabd06a5e4530e6ddf03ed7491c3.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $Z$ lies on the segment $GN$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{OG}=h$ and $\\overrightarrow{ON}=d$. The lengths satisfy $GZ:ZN=4:5$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{ZO}$ in terms of $h$ and $d$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{ZO}=$ {{field-1}} $h+$ {{field-2}} $d$"] [:db/add "a91daa27-1897-5aea-9a99-012820a6dea2" :question/worked-solution "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OG}=h\\qquad \\overrightarrow{ON}=d .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $G$ through $O$ to $N$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{GN}=\\overrightarrow{GO}+\\overrightarrow{ON}=-h+d.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $GZ:ZN=4:5$ gives $9$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{GZ}=\\frac{4}{9}\\overrightarrow{GN}=\\frac{4}{9}(-h+d).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to G\\to Z$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OZ}&=\\overrightarrow{OG}+\\overrightarrow{GZ}\\\\&=h+\\frac{4}{9}(-h+d)\\\\&=\\frac{5}{9}h+\\frac{4}{9}d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe requested vector has the reverse direction, so negate both coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{ZO}=-\\overrightarrow{OZ}=-\\frac{5}{9}h-\\frac{4}{9}d.\n$$"] [:db/add "a91daa27-1897-5aea-9a99-012820a6dea2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a91daa27-1897-5aea-9a99-012820a6dea2" :question/answer-fields "76d4a35d-8f3a-5fde-9014-f6f94077ba2f"] [:db/add "a91daa27-1897-5aea-9a99-012820a6dea2" :question/answer-fields "acde2936-d11f-58cc-b29e-e3774af4511b"] [:db/ensure "a91daa27-1897-5aea-9a99-012820a6dea2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "a91daa27-1897-5aea-9a99-012820a6dea2"] [:db/add "8edfdf6e-f396-54c1-a178-79210e2fdfcc" :answer/id #uuid "8edfdf6e-f396-54c1-a178-79210e2fdfcc"] [:db/add "8edfdf6e-f396-54c1-a178-79210e2fdfcc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8edfdf6e-f396-54c1-a178-79210e2