R=1:1$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{PO}$ in terms of $r$ and $a$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{PO}=$ {{field-1}} $r+$ {{field-2}} $a$"] [:db/add "fb3e8eda-0d7f-561e-ab3a-7a8d238c7f83" :question/worked-solution "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OH}=r\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OR}=-a .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $H$ through $O$ to $R$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{HR}=\\overrightarrow{HO}+\\overrightarrow{OR}=-r-a.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $HP:PR=1:1$ gives $2$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{HP}=\\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{HR}=\\frac{1}{2}(-r-a).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to H\\to P$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OP}&=\\overrightarrow{OH}+\\overrightarrow{HP}\\\\&=r+\\frac{1}{2}(-r-a)\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}r-\\frac{1}{2}a.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe requested vector has the reverse direction, so negate both coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{PO}=-\\overrightarrow{OP}=-\\frac{1}{2}r+\\frac{1}{2}a.\n$$"] [:db/add "fb3e8eda-0d7f-561e-ab3a-7a8d238c7f83" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "fb3e8eda-0d7f-561e-ab3a-7a8d238c7f83" :question/answer-fields "d190ef16-9b12-555a-a927-04d48ca1bac8"] [:db/add "fb3e8eda-0d7f-561e-ab3a-7a8d238c7f83" :question/answer-fields "226826f4-587b-53bc-abae-6d0b6d6f2ae5"] [:db/ensure "fb3e8eda-0d7f-561e-ab3a-7a8d238c7f83" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "fb3e8eda-0d7f-561e-ab3a-7a8d238c7f83"] [:db/add "5524e59d-5879-52c3-858f-a092bfb2d56d" :answer/id #uuid "5524e59d-5879-52c3-858f-a092bfb2d56d"] [:db/add "5524e59d-5879-52c3-858f-a092bfb2d56d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5524e59d-5879-52c3-858f-a092bfb2d56d" :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{5}"] [:db/ensure "5524e59d-5879-52c3-858f-a092bfb2d56d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "999b38d7-364c-579c-86f1-aec6b1fedbf4" :answer-field/id #uuid "999b38d7-364c-579c-86f1-aec6b1fedbf4"] [:db/add "999b38d7-364c-579c-86f1-aec6b1fedbf4" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "999b38d7-364c-579c-86f1-aec6b1fedbf4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "999b38d7-364c-579c-86f1-aec6b1fedbf4" :answer-field/choices "5524e59d-5879-52c3-858f-a092bfb2d56d"] [:db/add "999b38d7-364c-579c-86f1-aec6b1fedbf4" :answer-field/correct "5524e59d-5879-52c3-858f-a092bfb2d56d"] [:db/ensure "999b38d7-364c-579c-86f1-aec6b1fedbf4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3e230891-5bb0-5249-88ac-3e34977922bc" :answer/id #uuid "3e230891-5bb0-5249-88ac-3e34977922bc"] [:db/add "3e230891-5bb0-5249-88ac-3e34977922bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3e230891-5bb0-5249-88ac-3e34977922bc" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}"] [:db/ensure "3e230891-5bb0-5249-88ac-3e34977922bc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cd5579fa-e319-57a1-9675-b9304e68cf4a" :answer-field/id #uuid "cd5579fa-e319-57a1-9675-b9304e68cf4a"] [:db/add "cd5579fa-e319-57a1-9675-b9304e68cf4a" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "cd5579fa-e319-57a1-9675-b9304e68cf4a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "cd5579fa-e319-57a1-9675-b9304e68cf4a" :answer-field/choices "3e230891-5bb0-5249-88ac-3e34977922bc"] [:db/add "cd5579fa-e319-57a1-9675-b9304e68cf4a" :answer-field/correct "3e230891-5bb0-5249-88ac-3e34977922bc"] [:db/ensure "cd5579fa-e319-57a1-9675-b9304e68cf4a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f1d9f57f-2da1-5f18-892b-0bbbe6ce8516" :question/id #uuid "f1d9f57f-2da1-5f18-892b-0bbbe6ce8516"] [:db/add "f1d9f57f-2da1-5f18-892b-0bbbe6ce8516" :question/problem "![](images/58/5838af36cb81a941ddbbed58939640f1941bde8589c5e474cbfff1d22a3a6d80.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $T$ lies on the segment $LZ$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{OL}=a$ and $\\overrightarrow{ZO}=d$. The lengths satisfy $LT:TZ=1:4$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{TO}$ in terms of $a$ and $d$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{TO}=$ {{field-1}} $a+$ {{field-2}} $d$"] [:db/add "f1d9f57f-2da1-5f18-892b-0bbbe6ce8516" :question/worked-solution "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OL}=a\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OZ}=-d .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $L$ through $O$ to $Z$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{LZ}=\\overrightarrow{LO}+\\overrightarrow{OZ}=-a-d.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $LT:TZ=1:4$ gives $5$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{LT}=\\frac{1}{5}\\overrightarrow{LZ}=\\frac{1}{5}(-a-d).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to L\\to T$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OT}&=\\overrightarrow{OL}+\\overrightarrow{LT}\\\\&=a+\\frac{1}{5}(-a-d)\\\\&=\\frac{4}{5}a-\\frac{1}{5}d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe requested vector has the reverse direction, so negate both coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{TO}=-\\overrightarrow{OT}=-\\frac{4}{5}a+\\frac{1}{5}d.\n$$"] [:db/add "f1d9f57f-2da1-5f18-892b-0bbbe6ce8516" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "f1d9f57f-2da1-5f18-892b-0bbbe6ce8516" :question/answer-fields "999b38d7-364c-579c-86f1-aec6b1fedbf4"] [:db/add "f1d9f57f-2da1-5f18-892b-0bbbe6ce8516" :question/answer-fields "cd5579fa-e319-57a1-9675-b9304e68cf4a"] [:db/ensure "f1d9f57f-2da1-5f18-892b-0bbbe6ce8516" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "f1d9f57f-2da1-5f18-892b-0bbbe6ce8516"] [:db/add "76ddc9cf-f620-5ed5-859c-6dcbddf88fa0" :answer/id #uuid "76ddc9cf-f620-5ed5-859c-6dcbddf88fa0"] [:db/add "76ddc9cf-f620-5ed5-859c-6dcbddf88fa0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "76ddc9cf-f620-5ed5-859c-6dcbddf88fa0" :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{4}"] [:db/ensure "76ddc9cf-f620-5ed5-859c-6dcbddf88fa0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "78a7ed95-658a-5540-903c-ade15ef3d23e" :answer-field/id #uuid "78a7ed95-658a-5540-903c-ade15ef3d23e"] [:db/add "78a7ed95-658a-5540-903c-ade15ef3d23e" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "78a7ed95-658a-5540-903c-ade15ef3d23e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "78a7ed95-658a-5540-903c-ade15ef3d23e" :answer-field/choices "76ddc9cf-f620-5ed5-859c-6dcbddf88fa0"] [:db/add "78a7ed95-658a-5540-903c-ade15ef3d23e" :answer-field/correct "76ddc9cf-f620-5ed5-859c-6dcbddf88fa0"] [:db/ensure "78a7ed95-658a-5540-903c-ade15ef3d23e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d3d690fc-dd20-548e-beed-440ce9b6776a" :answer/id #uuid "d3d690fc-dd20-548e-beed-440ce9b6776a"] [:db/add "d3d690fc-dd20-548e-beed-440ce9b6776a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d3d690fc-dd20-548e-beed-440ce9b6776a" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}"] [:db/ensure "d3d690fc-dd20-548e-beed-440ce9b6776a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "089d9ea8-232d-5f4f-b067-b15b7fec146a" :answer-field/id #uuid "089d9ea8-232d-5f4f-b067-b15b7fec146a"] [:db/add "089d9ea8-232d-5f4f-b067-b15b7fec146a" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "089d9ea8-232d-5f4f-b067-b15b7fec146a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "089d9ea8-232d-5f4f-b067-b15b7fec146a" :answer-field/choices "d3d690fc-dd20-548e-beed-440ce9b6776a"] [:db/add "089d9ea8-232d-5f4f-b067-b15b7fec146a" :answer-field/correct "d3d690fc-dd20-548e-beed-440ce9b6776a"] [:db/ensure "089d9ea8-232d-5f4f-b067-b15b7fec146a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9578cbbf-db8f-5b1a-a0d7-1dd7aabb19b8" :question/id #uuid "9578cbbf-db8f-5b1a-a0d7-1dd7aabb19b8"] [:db/add "9578cbbf-db8f-5b1a-a0d7-1dd7aabb19b8" :question/problem "![](images/1c/1cc8caade45302ca676960270b0cd06b5eb7bad7f7a4ce7df84e0e2e57eba276.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $Z$ lies on the segment $BP$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{BO}=k$ and $\\overrightarrow{OP}=f$. The lengths satisfy $BZ:ZP=1:3$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{OZ}$ in terms of $k$ and $f$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{OZ}=$ {{field-1}} $k+$ {{field-2}} $f$"] [:db/add "9578cbbf-db8f-5b1a-a0d7-1dd7aabb19b8" :question/worked-solution "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OB}=-k\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OP}=f .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $B$ through $O$ to $P$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{BP}=\\overrightarrow{BO}+\\overrightarrow{OP}=k+f.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $BZ:ZP=1:3$ gives $4$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{BZ}=\\frac{1}{4}\\overrightarrow{BP}=\\frac{1}{4}(k+f).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to B\\to Z$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OZ}&=\\overrightarrow{OB}+\\overrightarrow{BZ}\\\\&=-k+\\frac{1}{4}(k+f)\\\\&=-\\frac{3}{4}k+\\frac{1}{4}f.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "9578cbbf-db8f-5b1a-a0d7-1dd7aabb19b8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "9578cbbf-db8f-5b1a-a0d7-1dd7aabb19b8" :question/answer-fields "78a7ed95-658a-5540-903c-ade15ef3d23e"] [:db/add "9578cbbf-db8f-5b1a-a0d7-1dd7aabb19b8" :question/answer-fields "089d9ea8-232d-5f4f-b067-b15b7fec146a"] [:db/ensure "9578cbbf-db8f-5b1a-a0d7-1dd7aabb19b8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "9578cbbf-db8f-5b1a-a0d7-1dd7aabb19b8"] [:db/add "8253ce40-2d3e-552e-b56c-8902f3fb9be1" :answer/id #uuid "8253ce40-2d3e-552e-b56c-8902f3fb9be1"] [:db/add "8253ce40-2d3e-552e-b56c-8902f3fb9be1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8253ce40-2d3e-552e-b56c-8902f3fb9be1" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{7}"] [:db/ensure "8253ce40-2d3e-552e-b56c-8902f3fb9be1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3f81e987-86da-5c02-88d2-be039d781897" :answer-field/id #uuid "3f81e987-86da-5c02-88d2-be039d781897"] [:db/add "3f81e987-86da-5c02-88d2-be039d781897" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "3f81e987-86da-5c02-88d2-be039d781897" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "3f81e987-86da-5c02-88d2-be039d781897" :answer-field/choices "8253ce40-2d3e-552e-b56c-8902f3fb9be1"] [:db/add "3f81e987-86da-5c02-88d2-be039d781897" :answer-field/correct "8253ce40-2d3e-552e-b56c-8902f3fb9be1"] [:db/ensure "3f81e987-86da-5c02-88d2-be039d781897" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f1bf8a96-02e2-5f1d-a6cd-e9b4e5b1b8e4" :answer/id #uuid "f1bf8a96-02e2-5f1d-a6cd-e9b4e5b1b8e4"] [:db/add "f1bf8a96-02e2-5f1d-a6cd-e9b4e5b1b8e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f1bf8a96-02e2-5f1d-a6cd-e9b4e5b1b8e4" :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{7}"] [:db/ensure "f1bf8a96-02e2-5f1d-a6cd-e9b4e5b1b8e4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ddbeeb70-9589-543c-80f7-04963cde5c07" :answer-field/id #uuid "ddbeeb70-9589-543c-80f7-04963cde5c07"] [:db/add "ddbeeb70-9589-543c-80f7-04963cde5c07" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "ddbeeb70-9589-543c-80f7-04963cde5c07" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ddbeeb70-9589-543c-80f7-04963cde5c07" :answer-field/choices "f1bf8a96-02e2-5f1d-a6cd-e9b4e5b1b8e4"] [:db/add "ddbeeb70-9589-543c-80f7-04963cde5c07" :answer-field/correct "f1bf8a96-02e2-5f1d-a6cd-e9b4e5b1b8e4"] [:db/ensure "ddbeeb70-9589-543c-80f7-04963cde5c07" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a816016f-6b49-55a2-bd0b-5642c635ab75" :question/id #uuid "a816016f-6b49-55a2-bd0b-5642c635ab75"] [:db/add "a816016f-6b49-55a2-bd0b-5642c635ab75" :question/problem "![](images/2b/2bc7f8a30eb99f7538ac0e56de515c8fabfee7315c0816934f7a69559d8d8fc4.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $P$ lies on the segment $LV$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{LO}=k$ and $\\overrightarrow{OV}=h$. The lengths satisfy $LP:PV=4:3$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{PO}$ in terms of $k$ and $h$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{PO}=$ {{field-1}} $k+$ {{field-2}} $h$"] [:db/add "a816016f-6b49-55a2-bd0b-5642c635ab75" :question/worked-solution "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OL}=-k\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OV}=h .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $L$ through $O$ to $V$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{LV}=\\overrightarrow{LO}+\\overrightarrow{OV}=k+h.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $LP:PV=4:3$ gives $7$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{LP}=\\frac{4}{7}\\overrightarrow{LV}=\\frac{4}{7}(k+h).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to L\\to P$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OP}&=\\overrightarrow{OL}+\\overrightarrow{LP}\\\\&=-k+\\frac{4}{7}(k+h)\\\\&=-\\frac{3}{7}k+\\frac{4}{7}h.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe requested vector has the reverse direction, so negate both coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{PO}=-\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\frac{3}{7}k-\\frac{4}{7}h.\n$$"] [:db/add "a816016f-6b49-55a2-bd0b-5642c635ab75" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a816016f-6b49-55a2-bd0b-5642c635ab75" :question/answer-fields "3f81e987-86da-5c02-88d2-be039d781897"] [:db/add "a816016f-6b49-55a2-bd0b-5642c635ab75" :question/answer-fields "ddbeeb70-9589-543c-80f7-04963cde5c07"] [:db/ensure "a816016f-6b49-55a2-bd0b-5642c635ab75" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "a816016f-6b49-55a2-bd0b-5642c635ab75"] [:db/add "9447e886-e39e-537f-89b8-12adfcfaaca7" :answer/id #uuid "9447e886-e39e-537f-89b8-12adfcfaaca7"] [:db/add "9447e886-e39e-537f-89b8-12adfcfaaca7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9447e886-e39e-537f-89b8-12adfcfaaca7" :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{6}"] [:db/ensure "9447e886-e39e-537f-89b8-12adfcfaaca7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e37a4c33-5262-52be-b4dc-39c75f0df991" :answer-field/id #uuid "e37a4c33-5262-52be-b4dc-39c75f0df991"] [:db/add "e37a4c33-5262-52be-b4dc-39c75f0df991" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "e37a4c33-5262-52be-b4dc-39c75f0df991" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e37a4c33-5262-52be-b4dc-39c75f0df991" :answer-field/choices "9447e886-e39e-537f-89b8-12adfcfaaca7"] [:db/add "e37a4c33-5262-52be-b4dc-39c75f0df991" :answer-field/correct "9447e886-e39e-537f-89b8-12adfcfaaca7"] [:db/ensure "e37a4c33-5262-52be-b4dc-39c75f0df991" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3b6ee078-c3b7-58ab-9b8c-9a7bfb43ac18" :answer/id #uuid "3b6ee078-c3b7-58ab-9b8c-9a7bfb43ac18"] [:db/add "3b6ee078-c3b7-58ab-9b8c-9a7bfb43ac18" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3b6ee078-c3b7-58ab-9b8c-9a7bfb43ac18" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}"] [:db/ensure "3b6ee078-c3b7-58ab-9b8c-9a7bfb43ac18" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f316e3a2-277d-534f-95c1-9f6df0e3ea87" :answer-field/id #uuid "f316e3a2-277d-534f-95c1-9f6df0e3ea87"] [:db/add "f316e3a2-277d-534f-95c1-9f6df0e3ea87" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "f316e3a2-277d-534f-95c1-9f6df0e3ea87" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f316e3a2-277d-534f-95c1-9f6df0e3ea87" :answer-field/choices "3b6ee078-c3b7-58ab-9b8c-9a7bfb43ac18"] [:db/add "f316e3a2-277d-534f-95c1-9f6df0e3ea87" :answer-field/correct "3b6ee078-c3b7-58ab-9b8c-9a7bfb43ac18"] [:db/ensure "f316e3a2-277d-534f-95c1-9f6df0e3ea87" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c279f3de-aa24-5bc6-a495-6951ddbeace7" :question/id #uuid "c279f3de-aa24-5bc6-a495-6951ddbeace7"] [:db/add "c279f3de-aa24-5bc6-a495-6951ddbeace7" :question/problem "![](images/47/47de13c04d8a4f092eba534f008107b14f6cb21530e554d95588868420c63823.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $V$ lies on the segment $TH$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{TO}=t$ and $\\overrightarrow{OH}=s$. The lengths satisfy $TV:VH=1:5$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{OV}$ in terms of $t$ and $s$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{OV}=$ {{field-1}} $t+$ {{field-2}} $s$"] [:db/add "c279f3de-aa24-5bc6-a495-6951ddbeace7" :question/worked-solution "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OT}=-t\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OH}=s .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $T$ through $O$ to $H$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{TH}=\\overrightarrow{TO}+\\overrightarrow{OH}=t+s.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $TV:VH=1:5$ gives $6$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{TV}=\\frac{1}{6}\\overrightarrow{TH}=\\frac{1}{6}(t+s).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to T\\to V$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OV}&=\\overrightarrow{OT}+\\overrightarrow{TV}\\\\&=-t+\\frac{1}{6}(t+s)\\\\&=-\\frac{5}{6}t+\\frac{1}{6}s.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "c279f3de-aa24-5bc6-a495-6951ddbeace7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c279f3de-aa24-5bc6-a495-6951ddbeace7" :question/answer-fields "e37a4c33-5262-52be-b4dc-39c75f0df991"] [:db/add "c279f3de-aa24-5bc6-a495-6951ddbeace7" :question/answer-fields "f316e3a2-277d-534f-95c1-9f6df0e3ea87"] [:db/ensure "c279f3de-aa24-5bc6-a495-6951ddbeace7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "c279f3de-aa24-5bc6-a495-6951ddbeace7"] [:db/add "df0de264-c9da-5934-941f-f8af6cffe4d0" :answer/id #uuid "df0de264-c9da-5934-941f-f8af6cffe4d0"] [:db/add "df0de264-c9da-5934-941f-f8af6cffe4d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "df0de264-c9da-5934-941f-f8af6cffe4d0" :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{8}"] [:db/ensure "df0de264-c9da-5934-941f-f8af6cffe4d0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5389eef6-cb96-5576-b3c4-a9d174db7c73" :answer-field/id #uuid "5389eef6-cb96-5576-b3c4-a9d174db7c73"] [:db/add "5389eef6-cb96-5576-b3c4-a9d174db7c73" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "5389eef6-cb96-5576-b3c4-a9d174db7c73" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "5389eef6-cb96-5576-b3c4-a9d174db7c73" :answer-field/choices "df0de264-c9da-5934-941f-f8af6cffe4d0"] [:db/add "5389eef6-cb96-5576-b3c4-a9d174db7c73" :answer-field/correct "df0de264-c9da-5934-941f-f8af6cffe4d0"] [:db/ensure "5389eef6-cb96-5576-b3c4-a9d174db7c73" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2d061a54-3a5c-566d-b9e3-23b928cea6eb" :answer/id #uuid "2d061a54-3a5c-566d-b9e3-23b928cea6eb"] [:db/add "2d061a54-3a5c-566d-b9e3-23b928cea6eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2d061a54-3a5c-566d-b9e3-23b928cea6eb" :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{8}"] [:db/ensure "2d061a54-3a5c-566d-b9e3-23b928cea6eb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "053dbf20-b2c5-5015-9025-6b93f21a4355" :answer-field/id #uuid "053dbf20-b2c5-5015-9025-6b93f21a4355"] [:db/add "053dbf20-b2c5-5015-9025-6b93f21a4355" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "053dbf20-b2c5-5015-9025-6b93f21a4355" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "053dbf20-b2c5-5015-9025-6b93f21a4355" :answer-field/choices "2d061a54-3a5c-566d-b9e3-23b928cea6eb"] [:db/add "053dbf20-b2c5-5015-9025-6b93f21a4355" :answer-field/correct "2d061a54-3a5c-566d-b9e3-23b928cea6eb"] [:db/ensure "053dbf20-b2c5-5015-9025-6b93f21a4355" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "133a09c2-d53b-54b1-853e-b4557bc43a10" :question/id #uuid "133a09c2-d53b-54b1-853e-b4557bc43a10"] [:db/add "133a09c2-d53b-54b1-853e-b4557bc43a10" :question/problem "![](images/68/682aad0345f61503231b5ec09012d343d194520f9a05e3a0582abfbc521a096a.png)\n\nIn the diagram, $T$ lies on the segment $WD$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{WO}=c$ and $\\overrightarrow{DO}=r$. The lengths satisfy $WT:TD=3:5$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{OT}$ in terms of $c$ and $r$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{OT}=$ {{field-1}} $c+$ {{field-2}} $r$"] [:db/add "133a09c2-d53b-54b1-853e-b4557bc43a10" :question/worked-solution "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OW}=-c\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OD}=-r .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $W$ through $O$ to $D$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{WD}=\\overrightarrow{WO}+\\overrightarrow{OD}=c-r.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $WT:TD=3:5$ gives $8$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{WT}=\\frac{3}{8}\\overrightarrow{WD}=\\frac{3}{8}(c-r).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to W\\to T$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OT}&=\\overrightarrow{OW}+\\overrightarrow{WT}\\\\&=-c+\\frac{3}{8}(c-r)\\\\&=-\\frac{5}{8}c-\\frac{3}{8}r.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "133a09c2-d53b-54b1-853e-b4557bc43a10" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "133a09c2-d53b-54b1-853e-b4557bc43a10" :question/answer-fields "5389eef6-cb96-5576-b3c4-a9d174db7c73"] [:db/add "133a09c2-d53b-54b1-853e-b4557bc43a10" :question/answer-fields "053dbf20-b2c5-5015-9025-6b93f21a4355"] [:db/ensure "133a09c2-d53b-54b1-853e-b4557bc43a10" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "133a09c2-d53b-54b1-853e-b4557bc43a10"] [:db/add "1792d050-da8b-5cc0-9fa7-e5a626287588" :answer/id #uuid "1792d050-da8b-5cc