 diagram, $S$ lies on the segment $ZF$. The given vectors are $\\overrightarrow{ZO}=e$ and $\\overrightarrow{FO}=d$. The lengths satisfy $ZS:SF=5:1$.\n\nExpress $\\overrightarrow{SO}$ in terms of $e$ and $d$. Fill in both coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{SO}=$ {{field-1}} $e+$ {{field-2}} $d$"] [:db/add "aea2c106-1d81-5af3-a66d-4867b94ad081" :question/worked-solution "First express both endpoint vectors in the directions away from $O$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OZ}=-e\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OF}=-d .\n$$\n\nTrace the path from $Z$ through $O$ to $F$:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{ZF}=\\overrightarrow{ZO}+\\overrightarrow{OF}=e-d.\n$$\n\nThe ratio $ZS:SF=5:1$ gives $6$ parts in the whole segment. Thus\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{ZS}=\\frac{5}{6}\\overrightarrow{ZF}=\\frac{5}{6}(e-d).\n$$\n\nAdd along the path $O\\to Z\\to S$ and collect coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overrightarrow{OS}&=\\overrightarrow{OZ}+\\overrightarrow{ZS}\\\\&=-e+\\frac{5}{6}(e-d)\\\\&=-\\frac{1}{6}e-\\frac{5}{6}d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe requested vector has the reverse direction, so negate both coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{SO}=-\\overrightarrow{OS}=\\frac{1}{6}e+\\frac{5}{6}d.\n$$"] [:db/add "aea2c106-1d81-5af3-a66d-4867b94ad081" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "aea2c106-1d81-5af3-a66d-4867b94ad081" :question/answer-fields "9fb2f619-4b48-5816-9626-e873dae993c8"] [:db/add "aea2c106-1d81-5af3-a66d-4867b94ad081" :question/answer-fields "db4ba39a-22f4-585c-a808-47d7effb8ee9"] [:db/ensure "aea2c106-1d81-5af3-a66d-4867b94ad081" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/questions "aea2c106-1d81-5af3-a66d-4867b94ad081"] [:db/ensure 17592186096653 :knowledge-point/validate]]
